tor","text":"Our field trip is It's a great month for field trips!","rects":[{"x":67.3727,"y":75.2819,"w":12.9034,"h":1.9802},{"x":63.4976,"y":77.2713,"w":22.5601,"h":1.9802},{"x":27.1711,"y":79.2604,"w":4.4015,"h":1.9802}],"ipa":"/ˌaʊə ˈfiːld ˈtrɪp ɪz ˌɪts ə ˈgreɪt ˈmʌnθ fɔː ˈfiːld ˈtrɪps!/","meaning":"我们的野外旅行是一个伟大的月 野外旅行！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s039.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s038","speaker":"narrator","text":"spring, we take a field trip.","rects":[{"x":44.0729,"y":75.2819,"w":22.6285,"h":1.9802}],"ipa":"/ˈsprɪŋ, wiː ˈteɪk ə ˈfiːld ˈtrɪp./","meaning":"春天，我们去实地考察","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s038.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s040","speaker":"narrator","text":"(usually/never) in April.","rects":[{"x":44.0729,"y":77.2713,"w":18.7534,"h":1.9802}],"ipa":"/(ˈjuːʒʊəliː ˈnevə) ɪn ˈeɪprɪl./","meaning":"(通常/从来没有)在4月。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s040.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s041","speaker":"narrator","text":"But the field trip","rects":[{"x":31.9062,"y":79.1278,"w":14.6135,"h":2.2454}],"ipa":"/ˌbʌt ðə ˈfiːld ˈtrɪp/","meaning":"但这次外出","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s041.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s053","speaker":"narrator","text":"(seldom/sometimes) takes","rects":[{"x":63.4167,"y":79.128,"w":22.5866,"h":2.2454}],"ipa":"/(ˈseldəm ˈsʌmtaɪmz) ˈteɪks/","meaning":"(出卖/有时)","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s053.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s042","speaker":"narrator","text":"place early May.","rects":[{"x":27.1719,"y":81.2498,"w":30.9123,"h":1.9804}],"ipa":"/ˈpleɪs ˈɜːliː ˈmeɪ./","meaning":"5月上旬的时候","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s042.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s043","speaker":"narrator","text":"David","rects":[{"x":14.1367,"y":82.2812,"w":5.5442,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˈdeɪvɪd/","meaning":"戴维","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s043.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s044","speaker":"narrator","text":"Every day, school starts 8 a.m.","rects":[{"x":27.172,"y":86.5497,"w":42.876,"h":1.9802}],"ipa":"/ˈevəriː ˈdeɪ, ˈskuːl ˈstɑːts ˈeɪt ˌeɪˈem/","meaning":"每天上午8点开始上学。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s044.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s045","speaker":"narrator","text":"I'm","rects":[{"x":70.7193,"y":86.5497,"w":2.6181,"h":1.9802}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪm/","meaning":"我是","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s045.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"I leave my home early every day.","rects":[{"x":69.268,"y":88.5391,"w":18.6391,"h":1.9802},{"x":27.1721,"y":90.5282,"w":8.4208,"h":1.9802}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈliːv maɪ ˈhəʊm ˈɜːliː ˈevəriː ˈdeɪ./","meaning":"我每天早早离开家。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s006.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s046","speaker":"narrator","text":"(often/never) late for school.","rects":[{"x":44.9023,"y":88.5391,"w":23.6945,"h":1.9802}],"ipa":"/(ˈɒfən ˈnevə) ˈleɪt fɔː ˈskuːl./","meaning":"(往往/永远)上学迟到。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s046.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"I don't like being late!","rects":[{"x":36.2642,"y":90.5282,"w":18.1548,"h":1.9802}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈdəʊnt ˈlaɪk ˈbiːɪŋ ˈleɪt!/","meaning":"我不喜欢迟到！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s007.wav"},{"id":"u14-p115-s047","speaker":"narrator","text":"Millie","rects":[{"x":14.1457,"y":91.6233,"w":5.3316,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˈmɪliː/","meaning":"米莉","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p115-s047.wav"}]},{"page":116,"pdfPage":117,"width":532.9130249023438,"height":754.0159912109375,"image":"assets/pages/page-116.webp","sentences":[{"id":"u14-p116-s015","speaker":"narrator","text":"Unit 4","rects":[{"x":9.5745,"y":3.6233,"w":6.0077,"h":1.8477}],"ipa":"/ˈjuːnɪt ˈfɔː/","meaning":"第4单元","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s015.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s016","speaker":"narrator","text":"B School trips","rects":[{"x":13.8298,"y":6.4851,"w":21.1785,"h":2.6041}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː ˈskuːl ˈtrɪps/","meaning":"B. 学 程","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s016.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s002","speaker":"narrator","text":"Listen to their talks and match the information below to the correct student.","rects":[{"x":77.297,"y":10.2356,"w":11.9195,"h":2.0721},{"x":13.8297,"y":12.225,"w":53.9217,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈlɪsən tə ðeə ˈtɔːks ænd ˈmætʃ ðiː ˌɪnfəˈmeɪʃən bɪˈləʊ tə ðə kəˈrekt ˈstjuːdnt./","meaning":"聆听他们的谈话，并将下面的信息与正确的学生匹配。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s002.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s001","speaker":"narrator","text":"B1 David’s friends Benny and Daisy are talking about their school trips.","rects":[{"x":14.5949,"y":10.2356,"w":62.2473,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː ˈwʌn ˈdeɪvɪdz ˈfrendz ˈbeniː ænd ˈdeɪziː ɑː ˈtɔːkɪŋ əˈbaʊt ðeə ˈskuːl ˈtrɪps./","meaning":"B1大卫的朋友Benny和Daisy正在谈论他们的学校旅行。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s001.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s003","speaker":"narrator","text":"1 a Trip place: a local farm.","rects":[{"x":13.6007,"y":16.3606,"w":1.1848,"h":1.7506},{"x":56.2285,"y":17.0447,"w":22.4598,"h":1.7375},{"x":49.8462,"y":17.0651,"w":1.1105,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˈwʌn ə ˈtrɪp ˈpleɪs: ə ˈləʊkəl ˈfɑːm./","meaning":"1 aTrip place:一个当地农场。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s003.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s018","speaker":"narrator","text":"Trip place:","rects":[{"x":56.2285,"y":22.2295,"w":9.9718,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈtrɪp ˈpleɪs:/","meaning":"旅行地点 :","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s018.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"an art museum.","rects":[{"x":66.7927,"y":22.2295,"w":15.0846,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ən ˈɑːt mjuːˈziːəm./","meaning":"一个艺术博物馆。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s004.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s017","speaker":"narrator","text":"b","rects":[{"x":49.8462,"y":22.2499,"w":1.286,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː/","meaning":"b","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s017.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"c The trip is in March.","rects":[{"x":56.2285,"y":27.4142,"w":19.6877,"h":1.7375},{"x":49.8462,"y":27.4347,"w":0.9867,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ðə ˈtrɪp ɪz ɪn ˈmɑːtʃ./","meaning":"c 旅行时间为3月。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s005.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"d The trip is in April.","rects":[{"x":56.2285,"y":32.599,"w":18.2717,"h":1.7375},{"x":49.8462,"y":32.6194,"w":1.288,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˈdiː ðə ˈtrɪp ɪz ɪn ˈeɪprɪl./","meaning":"d 旅行时间为4月。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s006.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"e The trip lasts the whole day.","rects":[{"x":56.2285,"y":37.7838,"w":27.0999,"h":1.7375},{"x":49.8462,"y":37.8042,"w":1.1291,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˈiː ðə ˈtrɪp ˈlɑːsts ðə ˈhəʊl ˈdeɪ./","meaning":"e 旅行持续一整天。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s007.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"f The trip is a half-day event.","rects":[{"x":56.2285,"y":42.9685,"w":26.3899,"h":1.7375},{"x":49.8462,"y":42.989,"w":0.7266,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˈef ðə ˈtrɪp ɪz ə ˈhɑːˌfdeɪ ɪˈvent./","meaning":"f 旅行为半天活动。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s008.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s009","speaker":"narrator","text":"B2 Do you go on school trips?","rects":[{"x":14.4449,"y":49.6009,"w":26.5551,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː ˈtuː ˈduː juː ˌgəʊ ˌɒn ˈskuːl ˈtrɪps?/","meaning":"B2，你上学旅行吗？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s009.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s010","speaker":"narrator","text":"When and where do you go?","rects":[{"x":41.4549,"y":49.6009,"w":25.078,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˌwen ænd ˌweə ˈduː juː ˌgəʊ?/","meaning":"你何时何去？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s010.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s011","speaker":"narrator","text":"What activities are there?","rects":[{"x":66.9877,"y":49.6009,"w":22.4459,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˌwɒt æˈktɪvɪtiːz ɑː ˈðeə?/","meaning":"有哪些活动？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s011.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s012","speaker":"narrator","text":"Work in pairs and talk about a school trip.","rects":[{"x":13.8296,"y":51.5902,"w":36.6663,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈwɜːk ɪn ˈpeəz ænd ˈtɔːk əˈbaʊt ə ˈskuːl ˈtrɪp./","meaning":"成对地工作，谈学之旅。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s012.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s013","speaker":"narrator","text":"Use the example below to help you.","rects":[{"x":50.9508,"y":51.5902,"w":31.0945,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈjuːz ðiː ɪˈgzɑːmpəl bɪˈləʊ tə ˈhelp juː./","meaning":"用下面的例子来帮助你。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s013.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s014","speaker":"narrator","text":"I’m excited about our school trip this term!","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":55.4034,"w":42.5143,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪm ɪˈksaɪtɪd əˈbaʊt ˌaʊə ˈskuːl ˈtrɪp ðɪs ˈtɜːm!/","meaning":"我对这个学期的学校之旅感到兴奋！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s014.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s019","speaker":"narrator","text":"A:","rects":[{"x":13.8298,"y":55.6228,"w":1.9692,"h":1.7506}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪ:/","meaning":"答复:","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s019.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s036","speaker":"narrator","text":"Oh, yes!","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":58.5429,"w":8.8215,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˈəʊ, ˈjes!/","meaning":"哦，对了！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s036.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s021","speaker":"narrator","text":"Where will we go?","rects":[{"x":25.5037,"y":58.5429,"w":18.6385,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌweə wɪl wiː ˌgəʊ?/","meaning":"我们要去哪里？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s021.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s020","speaker":"b","text":"B:","rects":[{"x":13.3419,"y":58.5633,"w":2.8603,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː:/","meaning":"B类:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s020.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s037","speaker":"narrator","text":"To the zoo!","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":61.6823,"w":11.6638,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/tə ðə ˈzuː!/","meaning":"去动物园！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s037.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s022","speaker":"a","text":"A:","rects":[{"x":13.3419,"y":61.7027,"w":2.9449,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪ:/","meaning":"答复:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s022.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s038","speaker":"narrator","text":"That’s great!","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":64.8218,"w":12.6474,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˈðæts ˈgreɪt!/","meaning":"这是伟大的！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s038.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s024","speaker":"narrator","text":"We can see a lot of animals there and learn so much about them.","rects":[{"x":29.3286,"y":64.8218,"w":63.4374,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː kæn ˈsiː ə ˈlɒt ɒv ˈænɪməlz ðeə ænd ˈlɜːn ˌsəʊ ˈmʌtʃ əˈbaʊt ˌðem./","meaning":"我们可以在那里看到很多动物， 并学到很多关于它们。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s024.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s023","speaker":"b","text":"B:","rects":[{"x":13.3419,"y":64.8422,"w":2.8603,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː:/","meaning":"B类:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s023.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s025","speaker":"narrator","text":"Animals are a big part of our world.","rects":[{"x":17.0697,"y":67.2085,"w":35.1082,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˈænɪməlz ɑː ə ˈbɪg ˈpɑːt ɒv ˌaʊə ˈwɜːld./","meaning":"动物是我们世界的一大部分。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s025.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s039","speaker":"narrator","text":"Yes, and animals are very interesting.","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":70.3479,"w":36.6336,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˈjes, ænd ˈænɪməlz ɑː ˈveriː ˈɪntrɪstɪŋ./","meaning":"是的，动物是非常有趣的。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s039.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s029","speaker":"narrator","text":"I never get tired of watching them.","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":70.3479,"w":74.2957,"h":4.5221}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈnevə get ˈtaɪəd ɒv ˈwɒtʃɪŋ ˌðem./","meaning":"我从不厌倦看他们。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s029.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s027","speaker":"narrator","text":"I love tigers.","rects":[{"x":53.3158,"y":70.3479,"w":12.6752,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈlʌv ˈtaɪgəz./","meaning":"我爱老虎。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s027.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s028","speaker":"narrator","text":"They look so cool.","rects":[{"x":65.6077,"y":70.3479,"w":18.5023,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌðeɪ ˈlʊk ˌsəʊ ˈkuːl./","meaning":"他们看起来很酷。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s028.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s026","speaker":"a","text":"A:","rects":[{"x":13.346,"y":70.3683,"w":2.9449,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪ:/","meaning":"答复:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s026.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s040","speaker":"narrator","text":"Me too.","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":75.8741,"w":8.3777,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌmiː ˈtuː./","meaning":"我也一样。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s040.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s031","speaker":"narrator","text":"When’s the trip?","rects":[{"x":25.06,"y":75.8741,"w":16.9294,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌwenz ðə ˈtrɪp?/","meaning":"旅行是什么时候？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s031.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s030","speaker":"b","text":"B:","rects":[{"x":13.3419,"y":75.8945,"w":2.8603,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː:/","meaning":"B类:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s030.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s041","speaker":"narrator","text":"It’s on 13 October.","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":79.0135,"w":18.6241,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˌɪts ˌɒn ˌθɜːˈtiːn ɒˈktəʊbə./","meaning":"这是在10月13日。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s041.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s033","speaker":"narrator","text":"We leave early in the morning and get back late in the afternoon.","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":79.0135,"w":36.2682,"h":6.9087}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː ˈliːv ˈɜːliː ɪn ðə ˈmɔːnɪŋ ænd get ˈbæk ˈleɪt ɪn ðiː ˌɑːftəˈnuːn./","meaning":"我们清晨离开，下午回来很晚","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s033.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s032","speaker":"a","text":"A:","rects":[{"x":13.3419,"y":79.0339,"w":2.9449,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪ:/","meaning":"答复:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s032.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s042","speaker":"narrator","text":"Sounds great!","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":86.9263,"w":13.8786,"h":2.1354}],"ipa":"/ˈsaʊndz ˈgreɪt!/","meaning":"听起来不错！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s042.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s035","speaker":"narrator","text":"That gives us lots of time at the zoo.","rects":[{"x":17.0656,"y":86.9263,"w":40.9166,"h":4.5221}],"ipa":"/ˈðæt ˈgɪvz ˌʌs ˈlɒts ɒv ˈtaɪm æt ðə ˈzuː./","meaning":"这给了我们很多时间在动物园。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s035.wav"},{"id":"u14-p116-s034","speaker":"b","text":"B:","rects":[{"x":13.3419,"y":86.9468,"w":2.8603,"h":2.1485}],"ipa":"/ˈbiː:/","meaning":"B类:","voice":"英式角色配音","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p116-s034.wav"}]},{"page":117,"pdfPage":118,"width":532.9130249023438,"height":754.0159912109375,"image":"assets/pages/page-117.webp","sentences":[{"id":"u14-p117-s030","speaker":"narrator","text":"Unit 4","rects":[{"x":84.4168,"y":3.6233,"w":6.0077,"h":1.8477}],"ipa":"/ˈjuːnɪt ˈfɔː/","meaning":"第4单元","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s030.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s031","speaker":"narrator","text":"C Interesting places at school","rects":[{"x":12.0053,"y":6.4851,"w":44.405,"h":2.6041}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˈɪntrɪstɪŋ ˈpleɪsɪz æt ˈskuːl/","meaning":"C 学校的有趣场所","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s031.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s003","speaker":"narrator","text":"Write a T if a sentence is true or an F if it is false.","rects":[{"x":81.68,"y":10.215,"w":8.0562,"h":2.1405},{"x":12.0052,"y":12.2043,"w":33.5805,"h":2.1405}],"ipa":"/ˈraɪt ə ˈtiː ɪf ə ˈsentəns ɪz ˈtruː ɔː ən ˈef ɪf ɪt ɪz ˈfɔːls./","meaning":"如果句子为真，则写 T；如果句子为假，则写 F。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s003.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s001","speaker":"narrator","text":"C1 Nora is reading an article about a great place at a school.","rects":[{"x":12.7669,"y":10.2356,"w":53.737,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˈwʌn ˈnɔːrə ɪz ˈriːdɪŋ ən ˈɑːtɪkəl əˈbaʊt ə ˈgreɪt ˈpleɪs æt ə ˈskuːl./","meaning":"C1 Nora正在读一篇关于学校一个好地方的文章。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s001.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s002","speaker":"narrator","text":"Read it with her.","rects":[{"x":66.9588,"y":10.2356,"w":14.2663,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈriːd ɪt wɪð ˌhɜː./","meaning":"跟她一起读吧","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s002.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"Then correct the false one(s).","rects":[{"x":46.0405,"y":12.225,"w":25.1075,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈðen kəˈrekt ðə ˈfɔːls ˈwʌn ˈes)./","meaning":"然后纠正错误的。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s004.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s032","speaker":"narrator","text":"A happy corner: our class farm","rects":[{"x":33.7912,"y":17.5004,"w":39.776,"h":2.2188}],"ipa":"/ə ˈhæpiː ˈkɔːnə: ˌaʊə ˈklɑːs ˈfɑːm/","meaning":"一个快乐的角落:我们的阶级农场","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s032.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"At school, we have a special corner.","rects":[{"x":20.0798,"y":20.6904,"w":33.977,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌæt ˈskuːl, wiː hæv ə ˈspeʃl ˈkɔːnə./","meaning":"在学校，我们有一个特殊的角落。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s005.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s033","speaker":"narrator","text":"There, we grow vegetables and","rects":[{"x":54.6492,"y":20.6904,"w":29.3333,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈðeə, wiː ˈgrəʊ ˈvedʒɪtəbəlz ænd/","meaning":"在那里，我们种植蔬菜","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s033.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"have interesting classes.","rects":[{"x":20.0798,"y":23.0771,"w":22.9015,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/hæv ˈɪntrɪstɪŋ ˈklɑːsɪz./","meaning":"有有趣的课程。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s006.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"We call it the “class farm”.","rects":[{"x":43.5737,"y":23.0771,"w":25.4276,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː ˈkɔːl ɪt ðə “ˈklɑːs ˈfɑːm”./","meaning":"我们称之为“阶级农场”。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s007.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s034","speaker":"narrator","text":"On the farm, you","rects":[{"x":69.5937,"y":23.0771,"w":16.6988,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɒn ðə ˈfɑːm, juː/","meaning":"在农场，你","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s034.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"can see cabbages, beans, tomatoes … and lots more!","rects":[{"x":20.0798,"y":25.4638,"w":35.3193,"h":1.7375},{"x":55.9915,"y":25.4638,"w":13.9081,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/kæn ˈsiː ˈkæbɪdʒɪz, ˈbiːnz, təˈmɑːtəʊz … ænd ˈlɒts ˈmɔː!/","meaning":"可以看到小白菜，豆子，番茄...还有更多！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s008.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s010","speaker":"narrator","text":"We use the farm to learn different things in many of our classes.","rects":[{"x":20.0798,"y":28.6033,"w":61.6823,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː ˈjuːz ðə ˈfɑːm tə ˈlɜːn ˈdɪfərənt ˈθɪŋz ɪn ˈmeniː ɒv ˌaʊə ˈklɑːsɪz./","meaning":"我们利用农场 学习不同的东西在我们的许多班级。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s010.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s035","speaker":"narrator","text":"On","rects":[{"x":82.3545,"y":28.6033,"w":3.0405,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɒn/","meaning":"打开","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s035.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s011","speaker":"narrator","text":"Tuesdays, we have a Biology class.","rects":[{"x":20.0798,"y":30.9899,"w":32.607,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈtjuːzdeɪz, wiː hæv ə baɪˈɒlədʒiː ˈklɑːs./","meaning":"星期二，我们有一个生物学课。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s011.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s036","speaker":"narrator","text":"We study different parts of plants,","rects":[{"x":53.2792,"y":30.9899,"w":32.6834,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː ˈstʌdiː ˈdɪfərənt ˈpɑːts ɒv ˈplɑːnts,/","meaning":"我们研究植物的不同部分，","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s036.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s012","speaker":"narrator","text":"such as the leaves, flowers and fruits.","rects":[{"x":20.0798,"y":33.3766,"w":35.5051,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈsʌtʃ æz ðə ˈliːvz, ˈflaʊəz ænd ˈfruːts./","meaning":"如叶，花和果实。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s012.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s013","speaker":"narrator","text":"We have an Art class on Fridays.","rects":[{"x":56.1773,"y":33.3766,"w":30.8952,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː hæv ən ˈɑːt ˈklɑːs ˌɒn ˈfraɪdeɪz./","meaning":"我们周五有艺术课","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s013.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s014","speaker":"narrator","text":"We draw beautiful pictures of our plants.","rects":[{"x":20.0798,"y":35.7633,"w":39.1875,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː ˈdrɔː ˈbjuːtɪfʊl ˈpɪktʃəz ɒv ˌaʊə ˈplɑːnts./","meaning":"我们画了我们植物的美丽照片。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s014.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s037","speaker":"narrator","text":"We also write about the","rects":[{"x":59.8597,"y":35.7633,"w":22.68,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː ˈɔːlsəʊ ˈraɪt əˈbaʊt ðə/","meaning":"我们还写关于","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s037.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s015","speaker":"narrator","text":"plants on the farm in our Chinese class.","rects":[{"x":20.0798,"y":38.15,"w":38.2999,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈplɑːnts ˌɒn ðə ˈfɑːm ɪn ˌaʊə ˌtʃaɪˈniːz ˈklɑːs./","meaning":"我们中国班的农场里的植物。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s015.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s016","speaker":"narrator","text":"Sometimes we take pictures of our plants.","rects":[{"x":20.0798,"y":41.2895,"w":39.9264,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈsʌmtaɪmz wiː ˈteɪk ˈpɪktʃəz ɒv ˌaʊə ˈplɑːnts./","meaning":"有时我们拍我们的植物的照片。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s016.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s038","speaker":"narrator","text":"Then, we share them on","rects":[{"x":60.5986,"y":41.2895,"w":23.3659,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈðen, wiː ˈʃeə ˌðem ˌɒn/","meaning":"然后，我们分享他们","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s038.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s017","speaker":"narrator","text":"our school website!","rects":[{"x":20.0798,"y":43.6762,"w":18.4966,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌaʊə ˈskuːl ˈwebsaɪt!/","meaning":"我们的学校网站！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s017.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s018","speaker":"narrator","text":"The class farm is a good place for learning!","rects":[{"x":39.1689,"y":43.6762,"w":40.878,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ðə ˈklɑːs ˈfɑːm ɪz ə ˈgʊd ˈpleɪs fɔː ˈlɜːnɪŋ!/","meaning":"阶级农场是学习的好地方！。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s018.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s019","speaker":"narrator","text":"1 The special corner is the class farm.","rects":[{"x":12.0049,"y":52.0514,"w":36.5949,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈwʌn ðə ˈspeʃl ˈkɔːnə ɪz ðə ˈklɑːs ˈfɑːm./","meaning":"1 特别角是班级农场。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s019.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s020","speaker":"narrator","text":"2 There are some small animals on the farm.","rects":[{"x":12.0049,"y":55.1909,"w":43.6522,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈtuː ˌðeə ɑː ˌsʌm ˈsmɔːl ˈænɪməlz ˌɒn ðə ˈfɑːm./","meaning":"2，农场内有一些小动物。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s020.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s021","speaker":"narrator","text":"3 Students study the farm plants in Biology class.","rects":[{"x":12.0049,"y":58.3304,"w":48.1313,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈθriː ˈstjuːdnts ˈstʌdiː ðə ˈfɑːm ˈplɑːnts ɪn baɪˈɒlədʒiː ˈklɑːs./","meaning":"3，学生在生物学班学习农田植物。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s021.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s022","speaker":"narrator","text":"4 Students have Maths class on the farm.","rects":[{"x":12.0049,"y":61.4698,"w":40.2835,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈfɔː ˈstjuːdnts hæv ˈmæθs ˈklɑːs ˌɒn ðə ˈfɑːm./","meaning":"4学生在农场开设数学课。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u14/u14-p117-s022.wav"},{"id":"u14-p117-s023","speaker":"narrator","text":"5 Students write about the farm in English class.","rects":[{"x":12.0049,"y":64.6093,"w":47.2148,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈfaɪv ˈstjuːdnts ˈraɪt əˈbaʊt ðə ˈfɑːm ɪn ˈɪŋglɪʃ ˈklɑːs./","meaning":"5，学生在英语课上写农场。","v